Error [E0922]: `Debug` derives automatically — writing it explicitly is retired
  --> tests/ui/E0922_explicit_debug_derive.jet:4:2
    |
  4 | #Debug
    |  ^^^^^
 Why: auto-derived `Debug` covers every type whose fields are all debuggable (S55); D-MARK-DEBUG1 retired the explicit opt-in spelling so there's exactly one way to get it (I8).
 Fix: remove `Debug` here — printing already works via `{value#Debug}` interpolation; implement `Debug` by hand (`impl T.Debug { fn debug(self) -> String { … } }`) only if you need custom output.
